            {
              "text": "In Adelaide’s luxury market—characterised by grand heritage mansions, leafy eastern-suburb estates, beachside architectural homes, and Adelaide Hills retreats—the top end of real estate is driven by personal reputations, private buyer networks, and bespoke presentation.\n\nHere is a curated shortlist of the best luxury real estate agencies in Adelaide, along with what sets them apart:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **Williams Real Estate (Williams Luxury)**\n* **Key Figures:** Stephanie Williams & John Williams  \n* **Core Territory:** Unley Park, Medindie, Springfield, Walkerville, North Adelaide, and eastern suburbs.  \n* **Why them:**  \n  Williams Luxury is widely considered the heavyweight benchmark of Adelaide's ultra-luxury segment. Stephanie and John Williams were the first agents in South Australia to crack eight-figure ($10M+) residential transactions (such as the landmark *Elysian* estate in Medindie). \n* **The Edge:** Exceptional styling, editorial-grade photography/videography, and an unmatched black book of Adelaide’s most affluent families and interstate buyers. If a blue-chip trophy estate hits the market, Williams is almost certainly in the conversation.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Fox Real Estate**\n* **Key Figures:** Andrew Fox  \n* **Core Territory:** North Adelaide, Medindie, Walkerville, and eastern foothill estates.  \n* **Why them:**  \n  Established in 2005 and headquartered in North Adelaide, Fox Real Estate is a boutique powerhouse synonymous with high-end architecture, significant return-verandah villas, and discreet high-value negotiations.\n* **The Edge:** Highly regarded for bespoke service and discretion. Andrew Fox maintains deep roots across Adelaide’s business community and medical/legal elite, frequently trading multi-million-dollar character homes off-market without ever needing a public billboard.\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Klemich Real Estate**\n* **Key Figures:** Matt Smith, Oren Klemich  \n* **Core Territory:** Toorak Gardens, Rose Park, Norwood, Burnside, Tusmore, and inner-south enclaves.  \n* **Why them:**  \n  Inducted into the REISA Hall of Fame, Klemich is Adelaide’s quintessential boutique agency. Matt Smith is a multi-time SA Salesperson of the Year, and founder Oren Klemich is one of the state's most respected property figures.\n* **The Edge:** Trusted advisory and longevity. Unlike agencies driven strictly by high volume, Klemich focuses heavily on relationship-driven, repeat-generation clients looking for heritage sandstone villas and family compounds across the eastern suburbs.\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Giordano & Partners (Luxury Real Estate Collection)**\n* **Key Figures:** Grant Giordano, Ross Smith  \n* **Core Territory:** Whole-of-state luxury: Adelaide Hills lifestyle estates, world-class Barossa/McLaren Vale vineyards, beachfront penthouses (Tennyson/Glenelg), and city mansions.  \n* **Why them:**  \n  Giordano & Partners operates purely in the luxury and super-prime tier. They are tailored specifically to high-net-worth (HNW) and ultra-high-net-worth (UHNW) clients, boasting international affiliations and marketing reach.\n* **The Edge:** Global perspective. They excel at marketing Adelaide's grandest lifestyle assets to expat capital, international buyers, and interstate downsizers looking for architectural showpieces or sprawling rural acreage.\n\n---\n\n### 5. **TOOP+TOOP Real Estate**\n* **Key Figures:** Anthony Toop, Genevieve Toop  \n* **Core Territory:** Inner-East, Burnside council area, Unley, and city fringe.  \n* **Why them:**  \n  An iconic, multi-award-winning South Australian brand, TOOP+TOOP has handled high-end sales for decades. They bridge the gap between boutique luxury representation and industry-leading technology.\n* **The Edge:** Proprietary systems like **ToopVault** (a private off-market matching platform). They have a vast pre-qualified database of buyers waiting to purchase off-market in premium eastern school zones, allowing sellers to test the waters quietly with maximum confidentiality.\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Harris Real Estate (Harris Prestige Division)**\n* **Key Figures:** Phil Harris, Michael Harris  \n* **Core Territory:** Eastern suburbs, prestige coastal strip (Somerton Park, Brighton, Henley Beach), and luxury modern developments.  \n* **Why them:**  \n  While Harris is one of SA’s largest independent firms, its dedicated **Harris Prestige** division specifically targets homes valued well above the median. \n* **The Edge:** Massive scale combined with sophisticated digital reach. If your luxury property suits a hyper-modern aesthetic, expansive digital campaign, and wide-reaching multi-channel media buy across Adelaide, Harris provides arguably the largest marketing megaphone in South Australia.\n\n---\n\n### Summary Recommendation:\n* For **record-setting mansions and grand heritage estates** in Medindie, Unley Park, or Springfield: Look first at **Williams Real Estate** or **Fox Real Estate**.\n* For **discreet, traditional Eastern Suburbs luxury** (villas, cottages, family estates in Burnside/Norwood): Consider **Klemich** or **TOOP+TOOP**.\n* For **trophy lifestyle properties, coastal retreats, or vineyard estates**: Consult **Giordano & Partners**.",
